# Coach fine-tune data artefacts under domains/coach-agent/ — regenerable from the
# scripts. The real-sample (step0_samples) + reconstructed-real (step0_eval, *_report)
# ones embed copyrighted source chunks; never commit. Track docs (*.md) + scripts
# (*.py/*.js) only. Add a specific synthetic file back with `git add -f` if needed.
domains/coach-agent/*.jsonl
domains/coach-agent/*.json
domains/coach-agent/step0_samples/
domains/coach-agent/step0_synth_prompts/
domains/coach-agent/v3_prompts/
